// --- Desk variants: drawing (v0.13) --------------------------------------------------------------
// A desk / boss desk in its variant and colour: the classic row draws with the type's own function
// (pixel-identical to 0.12 in wood), a variant with its row's draw(K, rot, C, on), desk-local (ctx
